# unsafe-libyaml, pulled in through pve-meta-core's serde_yaml_ng dependency,
# is a Rust transliteration of libyaml statically linked into the binary; the
# heuristic fires on libyaml's message text and symbol names, not on copied C
# object code. The same override, and the same reasoning at more length, is in
# debian/libpve-meta-rs-perl.lintian-overrides.
pve-meta-guest-files: embedded-library libyaml [usr/sbin/pve-meta-guest-files]
